 "text": "Hey! How's everything going? Storms can be unpredictable. Sure, take your time. If the storm hits in the afternoon or evening, the generator is the safest bet. Torchlights are cheap and give you something to do. The food is a bonus. If it' during the day, the in-laws are the simplest plan, as long as the drive is safe. Try getting in early and finding a cool spot near the door. Fans, cold drinks and earplugs help too. It' simple trick. The coolest spot is often near window seat.",
